HOW TO READ THIS, AND HOW NOT TO
  Do NOT pick the highest AUC. Twelve fits means the best one is
  above 0.50 by construction even when nothing predicts anything —
  that is the multiple-testing trap, and it is why this table is
  printed whole rather than sorted.
  A timeframe earns trust from STABLE FOLDS and a CLEAN SHUFFLE
  (~0.50), not from its mean. A spread wider than the distance
  from 0.50 means the mean is noise.

  at chance once fold spread is accounted for: 15m, 1d, 4h, 5m
